WEBVTT

00:05:58.527 --> 00:06:01.647
rechecked the list, fed the pets or whatever chores they had,

00:06:01.647 --> 00:06:04.071
checked the list once more, gathered their belongings,

00:06:04.071 --> 00:06:06.708
and made their way to the bus.

00:06:06.708 --> 00:06:10.785
It was one of the most astonishing family dynamics I have ever seen.

00:06:10.785 --> 00:06:13.927
And when I strenuously objected this would never work in our house,

00:06:13.927 --> 00:06:16.110
our kids needed way too much monitoring,

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.410
Eleanor looked at me.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:18.578
"That's what I thought," she said.

00:06:18.578 --> 00:06:20.898
"I told David, 'keep your work out of my kitchen.'

00:06:20.898 --> 00:06:22.519
But I was wrong."

00:06:22.519 --> 00:06:24.623
So I turned to David: "So why does it work?"

00:06:24.623 --> 00:06:27.559
He said, "You can't underestimate the power of doing this."

00:06:27.559 --> 00:06:29.093
And he made a checkmark.

00:06:29.093 --> 00:06:31.229
He said, "In the workplace, adults love it.